{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PPVR5GgkFqkWQtUBytQXYq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 降级为 \"directional evidence\"——embedding mining 方向一致但 95%\n2\t  CI 宽，至少一个编码器包含零。 Claim 2 降为 \"exploratory observation\"——dataflow 在 Qwen 上方向正确但不显著，StarCoder\n3\t  上甚至略负。 论文重心转向方法论贡献（controlled comparison framework + representation geometry analysis），\n4\t  效果量作为 preliminary evidence 呈现。SWE-bench 未能提供有说服力的下游验证。 \"tends to improve\" 替代 \"consistently\n5\t  improves\"。仍投 EMNLP Main，定位 analysis paper。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: SWE-bench Lite end-to-end evaluation\n10\t  plan_id: plan_003\n11\t  description: 3 strategies × best checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench Lite\n12\t    instances\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    random_resolve_rate_pct: 18.3\n15\t    embedding_distance_resolve_rate_pct: 18.7\n16\t    dataflow_aware_resolve_rate_pct: 18.0\n17\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.4\n18\t    dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.3\n19\t    retrieval_recall_at_5_random: 0.41\n20\t    retrieval_recall_at_5_embed: 0.43\n21\t    retrieval_recall_at_5_dataflow: 0.42\n22\t    instances_evaluated: 287\n23\t    instances_failed_agent_error: 13\n24\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 SWE-bench Δ ≤ 1pp。原因：(1) 300 实例中仅 ~50% 的 bug 与 retrieval\n25\t    质量相关， 其余受 patch generation 瓶颈限制——retriever 的 +1pp R@1 优势在 end-to-end pipeline\n26\t    中被稀释； (2) SWE-bench 的 repo 分布与训练集 SWE-smith 有 domain shift， m2_full 训练中观测到的 step\n27\t    1000 后过拟合加剧了这种 gap； (3) agent 的 file selection 依赖多轮交互，单次 retrieval 改进的边际效用递减。\n28\t    embedding 略优于 random 但幅度 <1pp，dataflow 因在 unseen repos 上结构信号噪声更大反而微跌。 整体 resolve\n29\t    rate ~18% 处于 baseline agent 的正常水平，无法宣称下游收益。\n30\t\n31\t    '\n32\t  tables:\n33\t  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Strategy'\n34\t    columns:\n35\t    - Strategy\n36\t    - Resolve Rate (%)\n37\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n38\t    - Retrieval R@5\n39\t    rows:\n40\t    - - random\n41\t      - '18.3'\n42\t      - —\n43\t      - '0.41'\n44\t    - - embedding_distance\n45\t      - '18.7'\n46\t      - '+0.4'\n47\t      - '0.43'\n48\t    - - dataflow_aware\n49\t      - '18.0'\n50\t      - −0.3\n51\t      - '0.42'\n52\t  figures_description:\n53\t  - 'Bar chart: resolve rate ± 95% binomial CI per strategy, 三根 bar 的 CI 完全重叠'\n54\t  analysis: 'SWE-bench 无法区分三种策略。写入论文时定位为 \"downstream evaluation shows no statistically\n55\t    distinguishable difference\"，并 acknowledge retrieval gains 在 end-to-end pipeline\n56\t    中 被 generation bottleneck 稀释。这不否定 retrieval 改进，但不能用作 downstream evidence。\n57\t\n58\t    '\n59\t- name: RepoBench-R cross-file retrieval evaluation\n60\t  plan_id: plan_004\n61\t  description: retrieval-only evaluation on RepoBench-R, 3 strategies × best checkpoint,\n62\t    两个编码器\n63\t  expected_results:\n64\t    qwen_random_R1: 0.312\n65\t    qwen_embed_R1: 0.325\n66\t    qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.318\n67\t    starcoder_random_R1: 0.274\n68\t    starcoder_embed_R1: 0.279\n69\t    starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.268\n70\t    qwen_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 1.3\n71\t    starcoder_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.5\n72\t    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.6\n73\t    starcoder_dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.6\n74\t  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 的 cross-file retrieval 与 SWE-smith 训练分布差异显著——RepoBench\n75\t    侧重 next-line completion 的上下文文件，粒度更细且不直接对应 bug-fix file selection。 median 档下 embedding\n76\t    优势方向保持但缩水：Qwen ~+1.3pp（pilot 中 +2.0pp 缩水约 35%， 因 domain shift 和 evaluation granularity\n77\t    不同），StarCoder ~+0.5pp（CI 将包含零）。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上仅 +0.6pp（RepoBench 的文件间 dataflow\n78\t    关系与训练时 CodeQL 提取的 分布不匹配），StarCoder 上略负。绝对 R@1 水平较低（0.27-0.33）因 RepoBench candidate\n79\t    pool 远大于 m2 验证集的 pool=50。方向一致性为 \"directional evidence\" 叙事提供第二个 benchmark 支持， 但效果量不足以做强声明。\n80\t\n81\t    '\n82\t  tables:\n83\t  - name: 'Table: RepoBench-R R@1 by Encoder × Strategy'\n84\t    columns:\n85\t    - Encoder\n86\t    - random\n87\t    - embedding\n88\t    - dataflow\n89\t    - embed Δ\n90\t    - dataflow Δ\n91\t    rows:\n92\t    - - Qwen2.5-Coder-3B\n93\t      - '0.312'\n94\t      - '0.325'\n95\t      - '0.318'\n96\t      - +1.3pp\n97\t      - +0.6pp\n98\t    - - StarCoder2-3B\n99\t      - '0.274'\n100\t      - '0.279'\n101\t      - '0.268'\n102\t      - +0.5pp\n103\t      - −0.6pp\n104\t  figures_description:\n105\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: R@1 per encoder × strategy，附 bootstrap 95% CI'\n106\t  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 结果与 SWE-smith eval 方向一致但效果量更小，增强 \"directional evidence\" 论点。\n107\t    写入论文时强调 cross-benchmark consistency of direction 而非 magnitude。\n108\t\n109\t    '\n110\t- name: Embedding vs random deep analysis by repo complexity\n111\t  plan_id: plan_005\n112\t  description: 按 repo size/complexity 分层分析 embedding negatives 的效果\n113\t  expected_results:\n114\t    small_repos_lt50_embed_delta_pp: 2.1\n115\t    medium_repos_50_200_embed_delta_pp: 1.0\n116\t    large_repos_200_500_embed_delta_pp: 0.3\n117\t    xlarge_repos_500plus_embed_delta_pp: -0.2\n118\t    complexity_correlation_r: -0.41\n119\t    complexity_correlation_p: 0.08\n120\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 embedding benefit 在小 repo 上最明显（candidate pool 小，embedding\n121\t    distance 能有效区分 near-miss），但随 repo 规模增大效果递减甚至反转。原因：大 repo 中 embedding space 拥挤程度更高，pretrained\n122\t    encoder 的 representation 更接近 saturation， embedding-distance mining 选出的 negatives\n123\t    与 random 的 difficulty 差异缩小。 相关性方向正确（r ≈ −0.41）但 p=0.08 不显著——样本量仅 123 repos 中有结构数据的子集，\n124\t    power 不足。此分析为 Claim 2 的 saturation 机制提供 supporting but inconclusive evidence。\n125\t\n126\t    '\n127\t  tables:\n128\t  - name: 'Table: Embedding Δ by Repo Size Tier (Qwen)'\n129\t    columns:\n130\t    - Tier\n131\t    - N repos\n132\t    - embed Δ R@1 (pp)\n133\t    - mean neg_difficulty margin\n134\t    rows:\n135\t    - - <50 instances\n136\t      - '1'\n137\t      - '+2.1'\n138\t      - '0.068'\n139\t    - - 50–200\n140\t      - '17'\n141\t      - '+1.0'\n142\t      - '0.032'\n143\t    - - 200–500\n144\t      - '40'\n145\t      - '+0.3'\n146\t      - '0.019'\n147\t    - - 500+\n148\t      - '29'\n149\t      - −0.2\n150\t      - '0.014'\n151\t  figures_description:\n152\t  - 'Scatter plot: repo size (x) vs embedding benefit Δ (y), with regression line\n153\t    and 95% CI band'\n154\t  - 'Box plot: neg_difficulty margin distribution by repo size tier'\n155\t  analysis: '趋势方向支持 saturation hypothesis 但统计力度不足（p=0.08）。 论文中作为 \"exploratory analysis\n156\t    suggesting repo complexity moderates embedding benefit\"， n=2 编码器 × uneven tier\n157\t    sizes 限制了因果推断。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t- name: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding ablation\n161\t  plan_id: plan_007\n162\t  description: 测试不同 call-graph 深度对 dataflow negative 质量的影响\n163\t  expected_results:\n164\t    hop1_qwen_R1: 0.531\n165\t    hop2_qwen_R1: 0.538\n166\t    hop3_qwen_R1: 0.534\n167\t    hop1_coverage_pct: 42.1\n168\t    hop2_coverage_pct: 34.3\n169\t    hop3_coverage_pct: 28.7\n170\t    hop2_vs_hop1_delta_pp: 0.7\n171\t    hop3_vs_hop2_delta_pp: -0.4\n172\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 hop 数的 ablation 呈倒 U 型但差异不大。2-hop（当前设置）略优于 1-hop 因为覆盖了更多真实的\n173\t    transitive dependencies，但 3-hop 引入过多 spurious connections （大 repo 中 3-hop 几乎把所有文件连通），diluting\n174\t    structural signal。 差异仅 ~0.7pp，在 cross-seed 方差 1.5-3.0pp 的背景下不显著。 Coverage 随 hop\n175\t    增加而下降（disconnected files 减少 → 可选 negative 减少）。 这说明当前 2-hop 设置合理但并非 critical design\n176\t    choice。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t  tables:\n180\t  - name: 'Table: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n181\t    columns:\n182\t    - Hops\n183\t    - R@1\n184\t    - Coverage (%)\n185\t    - Avg negatives/query\n186\t    rows:\n187\t    - - 1-hop\n188\t      - '0.531'\n189\t      - '42.1'\n190\t      - '8.3'\n191\t    - - 2-hop\n192\t      - '0.538'\n193\t      - '34.3'\n194\t      - '5.7'\n195\t    - - 3-hop\n196\t      - '0.534'\n197\t      - '28.7'\n198\t      - '3.9'\n199\t  figures_description:\n200\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs hop depth, with error bars from 3 seeds'\n201\t  analysis: '2-hop 是 sweet spot 但差异在噪声范围内。论文中简要报告作为 design justification， 不作为独立 finding。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t- name: Training data size scaling ablation\n205\t  plan_id: plan_008\n206\t  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances, 测试 data scaling behavior\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    size_1k_qwen_R1: 0.518\n209\t    size_3k_qwen_R1: 0.541\n210\t    size_5k_qwen_R1: 0.538\n211\t    size_1k_embed_delta_pp: 1.8\n212\t    size_3k_embed_delta_pp: 1.1\n213\t    size_5k_embed_delta_pp: 0.9\n214\t    size_1k_starcoder_R1: 0.432\n215\t    size_3k_starcoder_R1: 0.451\n216\t    size_5k_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n217\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 data scaling 呈 diminishing returns：1K→3K 有明显提升（+2.3pp），\n218\t    3K→5K 几乎持平甚至微降（过拟合加剧，与 m2_full 观察到的 step 1000 后过拟合一致）。 更关键的是 embedding benefit\n219\t    Δ 随数据量增加而缩小：1K 时 Δ=1.8pp（小数据下 hard negative 质量差异被放大），5K 时 Δ=0.9pp（更多数据提供足够 coverage，减少对\n220\t    mining 策略的依赖）。 这对 median 叙事不利——暗示在更大数据规模下 embedding benefit 可能进一步缩水。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t  tables:\n224\t  - name: 'Table: Data Scaling × Strategy (Qwen, embedding strategy)'\n225\t    columns:\n226\t    - Train Size\n227\t    - random R@1\n228\t    - embed R@1\n229\t    - Δ (pp)\n230\t    rows:\n231\t    - - 1K\n232\t      - '0.500'\n233\t      - '0.518'\n234\t      - '+1.8'\n235\t    - - 3K\n236\t      - '0.530'\n237\t      - '0.541'\n238\t      - '+1.1'\n239\t    - - 5K\n240\t      - '0.529'\n241\t      - '0.538'\n242\t      - '+0.9'\n243\t  figures_description:\n244\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs training data size, separate lines for random/embed/dataflow'\n245\t  - 'Bar chart: embed Δ at each data size, showing diminishing gap'\n246\t  analysis: 'Diminishing benefit at larger data scale 是 median 档的典型特征——方向正确但实际意义 随\n247\t    scale 递减。论文中诚实报告，作为 limitation 的一部分。\n248\t\n249\t    '\n250\t- name: Fusion head ablation\n251\t  plan_id: plan_009\n252\t  description: embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined scoring\n253\t  expected_results:\n254\t    embed_only_qwen_R1: 0.538\n255\t    struct_only_qwen_R1: 0.489\n256\t    combined_qwen_R1: 0.541\n257\t    embed_only_starcoder_R1: 0.451\n258\t    struct_only_starcoder_R1: 0.412\n259\t    combined_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n260\t    combined_vs_embed_only_delta_pp: 0.3\n261\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 structural features alone 表现较差（R@1=0.489），因为 CodeQL\n262\t    dataflow features 是 binary/sparse 的，单独使用缺乏 fine-grained discrimination。 Combined\n263\t    (embed + struct) 仅比 embed-only 好 +0.3pp——structural signal 的增量贡献在融合后被稀释，且 combined\n264\t    model 有更多参数容易过拟合（与 step 1000 过拟合现象一致）。StarCoder 上 combined 甚至略低于 embed-only（-0.3pp），\n265\t    因为 StarCoder 的 healthy representation space 不需要额外维度的信号。 这进一步支持 \"conditional benefit\"\n266\t    的定性结论但效果量太小。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t  tables:\n270\t  - name: 'Table: Fusion Head Ablation'\n271\t    columns:\n272\t    - Head\n273\t    - Qwen R@1\n274\t    - StarCoder R@1\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - embed-only\n277\t      - '0.538'\n278\t      - '0.451'\n279\t    - - struct-only\n280\t      - '0.489'\n281\t      - '0.412'\n282\t    - - combined\n283\t      - '0.541'\n284\t      - '0.448'\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - Stacked bar chart showing contribution decomposition of embed vs struct features\n287\t  analysis: 'Combined head 增益微乎其微，论文中报告为 \"structural features provide marginal additive\n288\t    benefit in fusion\"。不值得作为独立 contribution point。\n289\t\n290\t    '\n291\t- name: Dataflow-distance weighted negatives ablation\n292\t  plan_id: plan_010\n293\t  description: weighted sampling by dataflow distance vs binary connected/disconnected\n294\t  expected_results:\n295\t    binary_qwen_R1: 0.538\n296\t    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.535\n297\t    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n298\t    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.444\n299\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 weighted sampling 不优于 binary。原因：CodeQL 提取的 dataflow\n300\t    distance 分布高度 bimodal（connected with distance 1-2 占大多数，disconnected 占其余）， smooth\n301\t    weighting 在这种分布上退化为近似 binary。且 weighted 引入的额外超参数 （distance decay function）在 n=123\n302\t    repos 的数据量下难以 tune，noise 抵消了 理论上的 curriculum benefit。这是一个 null result，说明 binary\n303\t    structural signal 已捕获大部分可用信息。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t  tables:\n307\t  - name: 'Table: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n308\t    columns:\n309\t    - Method\n310\t    - Qwen R@1\n311\t    - StarCoder R@1\n312\t    rows:\n313\t    - - binary (current)\n314\t      - '0.538'\n315\t      - '0.448'\n316\t    - - distance-weighted\n317\t      - '0.535'\n318\t      - '0.444'\n319\t  figures_description:\n320\t  - Histogram of dataflow distances showing bimodal distribution\n321\t  analysis: 'Null result，论文中用一句话在 ablation section 报告：\"distance-weighted sampling\n322\t    does not improve over binary selection, likely due to the bimodal distance distribution.\"\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t- name: SWE-bench failure analysis\n326\t  plan_id: plan_011\n327\t  description: 50 SweRank/BM25 failure cases 分类分析\n328\t  expected_results:\n329\t    total_analyzed: 50\n330\t    category_retrieval_miss: 18\n331\t    category_generation_fail: 22\n332\t    category_test_flaky: 4\n333\t    category_multi_file_needed: 6\n334\t    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_helps: 5\n335\t    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_neutral: 10\n336\t    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_hurts: 3\n337\t    pct_dataflow_helps_of_retrieval_miss: 27.8\n338\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 failure analysis 揭示 SWE-bench 上 retrieval 并非主要瓶颈——\n339\t    50 个失败案例中仅 18 个（36%）是因为 retrieval miss，其余是 generation/test issues。 在 18 个 retrieval\n340\t    miss 中，dataflow 仅帮助 5 个（27.8%）——这些是跨文件依赖链上的 bug，dataflow connectivity 确实提供了有用信号。但\n341\t    10 个 neutral（文件间无 dataflow 关系或关系被 CodeQL 漏提取）和 3 个 hurt（dataflow 引入 noise 反而 distract）\n342\t    使整体效果被抵消。这解释了为什么 plan_003 中 SWE-bench resolve rate 差异 <1pp。\n343\t\n344\t    '\n345\t  tables:\n346\t  - name: 'Table: Failure Category Distribution'\n347\t    columns:\n348\t    - Category\n349\t    - Count\n350\t    - '%'\n351\t    rows:\n352\t    - - Retrieval miss\n353\t      - '18'\n354\t      - 36%\n355\t    - - Generation failure\n356\t      - '22'\n357\t      - 44%\n358\t    - - Flaky test\n359\t      - '4'\n360\t      - 8%\n361\t    - - Multi-file needed\n362\t      - '6'\n363\t      - 12%\n364\t  - name: 'Table: Dataflow Impact on Retrieval Misses'\n365\t    columns:\n366\t    - Dataflow effect\n367\t    - Count\n368\t    - '%'\n369\t    rows:\n370\t    - - Helps\n371\t      - '5'\n372\t      - 27.8%\n373\t    - - Neutral\n374\t      - '10'\n375\t      - 55.6%\n376\t    - - Hurts\n377\t      - '3'\n378\t      - 16.7%\n379\t  figures_description:\n380\t  - 'Sankey diagram: failure categories → dataflow impact'\n381\t  - 'Concrete example pair: one case where dataflow helped (cross-module dependency)\n382\t    and one where it hurt (false connectivity)'\n383\t  analysis: 'Failure analysis 提供定性 insight 但定量上支持 \"generation bottleneck dominates\n384\t    retrieval differences\" 的结论。论文中用于 explain 为什么 SWE-bench Δ 小， 并 motivate future\n385\t    work on generation-aware retrieval。\n386\t\n387\t    '\n388\t- name: Qualitative examples\n389\t  plan_id: plan_012\n390\t  description: 5-10 cases where structural negatives changed retrieval outcome\n391\t  expected_results:\n392\t    positive_examples_found: 4\n393\t    negative_examples_found: 2\n394\t    ambiguous_examples: 2\n395\t    total_curated: 8\n396\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下能找到 4 个 convincing positive examples（dataflow negative\n397\t    帮助 retriever 区分 lexically similar but structurally unrelated files），但也有 2 个 negative\n398\t    examples（dataflow 引入的 structural bias 导致 miss）。 这与 median 的 \"directional but not\n399\t    definitive\" 叙事一致。8 个案例中 pattern 不够 clean 来支持强因果推断——n=2 编码器 + case-by-case 分析 只能说明\n400\t    mechanism 是 plausible 而非 proven。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t  tables: []\n404\t  figures_description:\n405\t  - 'Figure: 2 positive + 1 negative case study panels, showing query → retrieved\n406\t    files → gold files, with dataflow graph overlay'\n407\t  analysis: '精选 cases 放入论文 qualitative section，明确标注 positive 和 negative examples 以保持学术诚实。reviewer\n408\t    会 appreciate balanced presentation。\n409\t\n410\t    '\n411\t- name: Temperature ablation\n412\t  plan_id: plan_014\n413\t  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}, 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n414\t  expected_results:\n415\t    qwen_tau005_random_R1: 0.521\n416\t    qwen_tau005_embed_R1: 0.534\n417\t    qwen_tau005_dataflow_R1: 0.53\n418\t    qwen_tau010_random_R1: 0.533\n419\t    qwen_tau010_embed_R1: 0.543\n420\t    qwen_tau010_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n421\t    qwen_tau020_random_R1: 0.524\n422\t    qwen_tau020_embed_R1: 0.531\n423\t    qwen_tau020_dataflow_R1: 0.527\n424\t    starcoder_tau005_random_R1: 0.438\n425\t    starcoder_tau005_embed_R1: 0.443\n426\t    starcoder_tau005_dataflow_R1: 0.43\n427\t    starcoder_tau010_random_R1: 0.449\n428\t    starcoder_tau010_embed_R1: 0.456\n429\t    starcoder_tau010_dataflow_R1: 0.441\n430\t    starcoder_tau020_random_R1: 0.442\n431\t    starcoder_tau020_embed_R1: 0.446\n432\t    starcoder_tau020_dataflow_R1: 0.435\n433\t    embed_benefit_direction_consistent_across_tau: true\n434\t    dataflow_benefit_direction_inconsistent: true\n435\t    optimal_tau: 0.1\n436\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 temperature ablation 证明 embedding > random 的方向在所有 τ\n437\t    值下一致 （这是好消息，说明发现非 regime-specific）。但 Δ 在 τ=0.05 和 τ=0.2 下缩小： τ=0.05 时 loss landscape\n438\t    过于 sharp，所有策略表现都下降，差异被 noise 淹没； τ=0.2 时 loss 太平滑，hard negatives 的难度梯度被抹平。τ=0.1\n439\t    是 sweet spot。 Dataflow 的方向在 τ 间不一致——τ=0.05 时 Qwen 上 dataflow 略优于 random， τ=0.2\n440\t    时略劣——进一步支持 \"conditional and fragile\" 的定性判断。 Cross-seed 方差在 τ=0.05 下最大（~3.0pp std），τ=0.1\n441\t    最稳定（~1.8pp std）。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t  tables:\n445\t  - name: 'Table: Temperature × Strategy R@1 (Qwen)'\n446\t    columns:\n447\t    - τ\n448\t    - random\n449\t    - embed\n450\t    - dataflow\n451\t    - embed Δ\n452\t    - dataflow Δ\n453\t    rows:\n454\t    - - '0.05'\n455\t      - '0.521'\n456\t      - '0.534'\n457\t      - '0.530'\n458\t      - '+1.3'\n459\t      - '+0.9'\n460\t    - - '0.10'\n461\t      - '0.533'\n462\t      - '0.543'\n463\t      - '0.538'\n464\t      - '+1.0'\n465\t      - '+0.5'\n466\t    - - '0.20'\n467\t      - '0.524'\n468\t      - '0.531'\n469\t      - '0.527'\n470\t      - '+0.7'\n471\t      - '+0.3'\n472\t  - name: 'Table: Temperature × Strategy R@1 (StarCoder)'\n473\t    columns:\n474\t    - τ\n475\t    - random\n476\t    - embed\n477\t    - dataflow\n478\t    - embed Δ\n479\t    - dataflow Δ\n480\t    rows:\n481\t    - - '0.05'\n482\t      - '0.438'\n483\t      - '0.443'\n484\t      - '0.430'\n485\t      - '+0.5'\n486\t      - −0.8\n487\t    - - '0.10'\n488\t      - '0.449'\n489\t      - '0.456'\n490\t      - '0.441'\n491\t      - '+0.7'\n492\t      - −0.8\n493\t    - - '0.20'\n494\t      - '0.442'\n495\t      - '0.446'\n496\t      - '0.435'\n497\t      - '+0.4'\n498\t      - −0.7\n499\t  figures_description:\n500\t  - 'Heatmap: τ × strategy, cell color = R@1, separate panels for Qwen and StarCoder'\n501\t  - 'Line plot: embed Δ vs τ, showing consistent positive direction'\n502\t  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 是 median 档的关键正面结果之一：embedding benefit 方向 robust\n503\t    across τ。 论文中重点报告此 robustness 作为 Claim 1 的 supporting evidence， 同时 acknowledge\n504\t    Claim 2 (dataflow) 的 τ-sensitivity 作为 limitation。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t- name: Dynamic mining baseline\n508\t  plan_id: plan_015\n509\t  description: re-mine embedding negatives per epoch vs static (mine once from pretrained)\n510\t  expected_results:\n511\t    static_qwen_R1: 0.543\n512\t    dynamic_qwen_R1: 0.547\n513\t    static_starcoder_R1: 0.456\n514\t    dynamic_starcoder_R1: 0.452\n515\t    dynamic_vs_static_qwen_delta_pp: 0.4\n516\t    dynamic_vs_static_starcoder_delta_pp: -0.4\n517\t    dynamic_compute_overhead_factor: 3.2\n518\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 dynamic mining 在 Qwen 上微优（+0.4pp）但 StarCoder 上微劣（-0.4pp），\n519\t    差异在 noise 范围内。原因：(1) static mining 在仅 3 epoch 的训练中 representation drift 有限——encoder\n520\t    是 LoRA fine-tune，参数变化量小，pretrained 时的 embedding distance 排序在训练后基本保持；(2) dynamic\n521\t    re-mining 引入计算开销（3.2x）但因 LoRA 的低 drift 几乎不改变 negative selection；(3) StarCoder\n522\t    上 dynamic 略差可能因 re-mining 引入的 randomness（每次 re-mining 的 batch 不完全一致）。结论：static\n523\t    vs dynamic 不是 关键 confound，当前 static 设计合理。\n524\t\n525\t    '\n526\t  tables:\n527\t  - name: 'Table: Static vs Dynamic Mining'\n528\t    columns:\n529\t    - Mining\n530\t    - Qwen R@1\n531\t    - StarCoder R@1\n532\t    - GPU hours\n533\t    rows:\n534\t    - - Static (current)\n535\t      - '0.543'\n536\t      - '0.456'\n537\t      - '3.5'\n538\t    - - Dynamic (per-epoch)\n539\t      - '0.547'\n540\t      - '0.452'\n541\t      - '11.2'\n542\t  figures_description:\n543\t  - 'Bar chart: static vs dynamic R@1, with compute cost annotation'\n544\t  analysis: 'Null result for practical purposes. 论文中一句话报告：\"dynamic re-mining does\n545\t    not significantly improve over static mining given the limited representation\n546\t    drift in LoRA fine-tuning (3 epochs)\"。排除了 reviewer concern about static/dynamic\n547\t    confound。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t- name: Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Lite\n551\t  plan_id: plan_016\n552\t  description: 95% bootstrap CI for resolve rate differences\n553\t  expected_results:\n554\t    embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.4\n555\t    embed_vs_random_95ci_lower: -1.8\n556\t    embed_vs_random_95ci_upper: 2.6\n557\t    dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.3\n558\t    dataflow_vs_random_95ci_lower: -2.5\n559\t    dataflow_vs_random_95ci_upper: 1.9\n560\t    bootstrap_n: 10000\n561\t    embed_vs_random_p_value: 0.34\n562\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 SWE-bench 的 Δ ≤ 1pp，在 300 instances 上 bootstrap CI\n563\t    极宽。 300 实例的 binomial 标准误约 ±2.2pp（at resolve rate ~18%）， 所以 Δ=0.4pp 的 95% CI 为\n564\t    [-1.8, +2.6]，包含零。p=0.34 远不显著。 这是 median 档的核心弱点：无法宣称下游收益。 Dataflow 的 CI 同样包含零且\n565\t    point estimate 为负。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t  tables:\n569\t  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Bootstrap CI'\n570\t    columns:\n571\t    - Comparison\n572\t    - Δ (pp)\n573\t    - 95% CI\n574\t    - p-value\n575\t    rows:\n576\t    - - embed vs random\n577\t      - '+0.4'\n578\t      - '[−1.8, +2.6]'\n579\t      - '0.34'\n580\t    - - dataflow vs random\n581\t      - −0.3\n582\t      - '[−2.5, +1.9]'\n583\t      - '0.41'\n584\t  figures_description:\n585\t  - 'Forest plot: point estimates with 95% CI bars, reference line at zero'\n586\t  analysis: 'CI 均包含零，论文中必须诚实报告 \"no statistically significant difference in downstream\n587\t    resolve rate\"。但可同时 argue retrieval-level improvements (plan_002/plan_013) 的 bootstrap\n588\t    CI 更紧（pool=50 的 val set 上）， downstream pipeline 的 noise 是 confound 而非 evidence\n589\t    against retrieval gains。\n590\t\n591\t    '\n592\t- name: Inference-time graph method comparison discussion\n593\t  plan_id: plan_017\n594\t  description: 与 CodexGraph, LocAgent 等 inference-time 方法的定位比较\n595\t  expected_results:\n596\t    comparison_type: qualitative_discussion\n597\t    codexgraph_reported_R1_improvement_pp: 5.2\n598\t    locagent_reported_resolve_rate_pct: 26.3\n599\t    structfuse_retrieval_R1: 0.543\n600\t    key_distinction: training-time vs inference-time structural signal\n601\t    complementarity_argument_strength: moderate\n602\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下此项为 qualitative discussion 而非实验。StructFuse（training-time\n603\t    structural mining）与 CodexGraph/LocAgent（inference-time graph navigation） 在方法论上互补：前者提升\n604\t    base retriever 质量，后者在 inference 时做 multi-hop reasoning。但 median 档下 StructFuse\n605\t    的 absolute improvement 较小（+1pp R@1）， complementarity argument 的说服力为 \"moderate\"——reviewer\n606\t    可能问 \"if inference-time methods already get +5pp, why bother with +1pp training-time\n607\t    improvement?\" 回应：training-time improvement 是 zero-cost at inference，可叠加使用。\n608\t\n609\t    '\n610\t  tables:\n611\t  - name: 'Table: Training-time vs Inference-time Structural Methods'\n612\t    columns:\n613\t    - Method\n614\t    - Type\n615\t    - Structural Signal\n616\t    - Inference Cost\n617\t    - Reported Gain\n618\t    rows:\n619\t    - - StructFuse (ours)\n620\t      - training-time\n621\t      - CodeQL dataflow\n622\t      - zero\n623\t      - +0.5–1.5pp R@1\n624\t    - - CodexGraph\n625\t      - inference-time\n626\t      - LLM-built graph\n627\t      - high (LLM calls)\n628\t      - +5.2pp R@1\n629\t    - - LocAgent\n630\t      - inference-time\n631\t      - call graph navigation\n632\t      - moderate\n633\t      - 26.3% resolve\n634\t  figures_description:\n635\t  - Comparison table in Related Work section\n636\t  analysis: Discussion section 而非实验。定位 StructFuse 为 complementary approach—— zero\n637\t    inference cost, improves base retriever that inference-time methods build upon.\n638\t    Acknowledge median 档的 modest gains 使此 argument 需要 future work validation。\n639\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f4534d40-6470-414b-bd76-f15880fb0e07","uuid":"91276c69-9cd3-41f9-98b3-46ece9edf676","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:30:18.603Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T075732/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 降级为 \"directional evidence\"——embedding mining 方向一致但 95%\n  CI 宽，至少一个编码器包含零。 Claim 2 降为 \"exploratory observation\"——dataflow 在 Qwen 上方向正确但不显著，StarCoder\n  上甚至略负。 论文重心转向方法论贡献（controlled comparison framework + representation geometry analysis），\n  效果量作为 preliminary evidence 呈现。SWE-bench 未能提供有说服力的下游验证。 \"tends to improve\" 替代 \"consistently\n  improves\"。仍投 EMNLP Main，定位 analysis paper。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: SWE-bench Lite end-to-end evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 3 strategies × best checkpoint, Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench Lite\n    instances\n  expected_results:\n    random_resolve_rate_pct: 18.3\n    embedding_distance_resolve_rate_pct: 18.7\n    dataflow_aware_resolve_rate_pct: 18.0\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.4\n    dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.3\n    retrieval_recall_at_5_random: 0.41\n    retrieval_recall_at_5_embed: 0.43\n    retrieval_recall_at_5_dataflow: 0.42\n    instances_evaluated: 287\n    instances_failed_agent_error: 13\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 SWE-bench Δ ≤ 1pp。原因：(1) 300 实例中仅 ~50% 的 bug 与 retrieval\n    质量相关， 其余受 patch generation 瓶颈限制——retriever 的 +1pp R@1 优势在 end-to-end pipeline\n    中被稀释； (2) SWE-bench 的 repo 分布与训练集 SWE-smith 有 domain shift， m2_full 训练中观测到的 step\n    1000 后过拟合加剧了这种 gap； (3) agent 的 file selection 依赖多轮交互，单次 retrieval 改进的边际效用递减。\n    embedding 略优于 random 但幅度 <1pp，dataflow 因在 unseen repos 上结构信号噪声更大反而微跌。 整体 resolve\n    rate ~18% 处于 baseline agent 的正常水平，无法宣称下游收益。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Strategy'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Resolve Rate (%)\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    - Retrieval R@5\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - '18.3'\n      - —\n      - '0.41'\n    - - embedding_distance\n      - '18.7'\n      - '+0.4'\n      - '0.43'\n    - - dataflow_aware\n      - '18.0'\n      - −0.3\n      - '0.42'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: resolve rate ± 95% binomial CI per strategy, 三根 bar 的 CI 完全重叠'\n  analysis: 'SWE-bench 无法区分三种策略。写入论文时定位为 \"downstream evaluation shows no statistically\n    distinguishable difference\"，并 acknowledge retrieval gains 在 end-to-end pipeline\n    中 被 generation bottleneck 稀释。这不否定 retrieval 改进，但不能用作 downstream evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: RepoBench-R cross-file retrieval evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: retrieval-only evaluation on RepoBench-R, 3 strategies × best checkpoint,\n    两个编码器\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_random_R1: 0.312\n    qwen_embed_R1: 0.325\n    qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.318\n    starcoder_random_R1: 0.274\n    starcoder_embed_R1: 0.279\n    starcoder_dataflow_R1: 0.268\n    qwen_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 1.3\n    starcoder_embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.5\n    qwen_dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.6\n    starcoder_dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.6\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 的 cross-file retrieval 与 SWE-smith 训练分布差异显著——RepoBench\n    侧重 next-line completion 的上下文文件，粒度更细且不直接对应 bug-fix file selection。 median 档下 embedding\n    优势方向保持但缩水：Qwen ~+1.3pp（pilot 中 +2.0pp 缩水约 35%， 因 domain shift 和 evaluation granularity\n    不同），StarCoder ~+0.5pp（CI 将包含零）。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上仅 +0.6pp（RepoBench 的文件间 dataflow\n    关系与训练时 CodeQL 提取的 分布不匹配），StarCoder 上略负。绝对 R@1 水平较低（0.27-0.33）因 RepoBench candidate\n    pool 远大于 m2 验证集的 pool=50。方向一致性为 \"directional evidence\" 叙事提供第二个 benchmark 支持， 但效果量不足以做强声明。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RepoBench-R R@1 by Encoder × Strategy'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - embed Δ\n    - dataflow Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-Coder-3B\n      - '0.312'\n      - '0.325'\n      - '0.318'\n      - +1.3pp\n      - +0.6pp\n    - - StarCoder2-3B\n      - '0.274'\n      - '0.279'\n      - '0.268'\n      - +0.5pp\n      - −0.6pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: R@1 per encoder × strategy，附 bootstrap 95% CI'\n  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 结果与 SWE-smith eval 方向一致但效果量更小，增强 \"directional evidence\" 论点。\n    写入论文时强调 cross-benchmark consistency of direction 而非 magnitude。\n\n    '\n- name: Embedding vs random deep analysis by repo complexity\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 按 repo size/complexity 分层分析 embedding negatives 的效果\n  expected_results:\n    small_repos_lt50_embed_delta_pp: 2.1\n    medium_repos_50_200_embed_delta_pp: 1.0\n    large_repos_200_500_embed_delta_pp: 0.3\n    xlarge_repos_500plus_embed_delta_pp: -0.2\n    complexity_correlation_r: -0.41\n    complexity_correlation_p: 0.08\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 embedding benefit 在小 repo 上最明显（candidate pool 小，embedding\n    distance 能有效区分 near-miss），但随 repo 规模增大效果递减甚至反转。原因：大 repo 中 embedding space 拥挤程度更高，pretrained\n    encoder 的 representation 更接近 saturation， embedding-distance mining 选出的 negatives\n    与 random 的 difficulty 差异缩小。 相关性方向正确（r ≈ −0.41）但 p=0.08 不显著——样本量仅 123 repos 中有结构数据的子集，\n    power 不足。此分析为 Claim 2 的 saturation 机制提供 supporting but inconclusive evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Embedding Δ by Repo Size Tier (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - N repos\n    - embed Δ R@1 (pp)\n    - mean neg_difficulty margin\n    rows:\n    - - <50 instances\n      - '1'\n      - '+2.1'\n      - '0.068'\n    - - 50–200\n      - '17'\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '0.032'\n    - - 200–500\n      - '40'\n      - '+0.3'\n      - '0.019'\n    - - 500+\n      - '29'\n      - −0.2\n      - '0.014'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: repo size (x) vs embedding benefit Δ (y), with regression line\n    and 95% CI band'\n  - 'Box plot: neg_difficulty margin distribution by repo size tier'\n  analysis: '趋势方向支持 saturation hypothesis 但统计力度不足（p=0.08）。 论文中作为 \"exploratory analysis\n    suggesting repo complexity moderates embedding benefit\"， n=2 编码器 × uneven tier\n    sizes 限制了因果推断。\n\n    '\n- name: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding ablation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 测试不同 call-graph 深度对 dataflow negative 质量的影响\n  expected_results:\n    hop1_qwen_R1: 0.531\n    hop2_qwen_R1: 0.538\n    hop3_qwen_R1: 0.534\n    hop1_coverage_pct: 42.1\n    hop2_coverage_pct: 34.3\n    hop3_coverage_pct: 28.7\n    hop2_vs_hop1_delta_pp: 0.7\n    hop3_vs_hop2_delta_pp: -0.4\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 hop 数的 ablation 呈倒 U 型但差异不大。2-hop（当前设置）略优于 1-hop 因为覆盖了更多真实的\n    transitive dependencies，但 3-hop 引入过多 spurious connections （大 repo 中 3-hop 几乎把所有文件连通），diluting\n    structural signal。 差异仅 ~0.7pp，在 cross-seed 方差 1.5-3.0pp 的背景下不显著。 Coverage 随 hop\n    增加而下降（disconnected files 减少 → 可选 negative 减少）。 这说明当前 2-hop 设置合理但并非 critical design\n    choice。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - R@1\n    - Coverage (%)\n    - Avg negatives/query\n    rows:\n    - - 1-hop\n      - '0.531'\n      - '42.1'\n      - '8.3'\n    - - 2-hop\n      - '0.538'\n      - '34.3'\n      - '5.7'\n    - - 3-hop\n      - '0.534'\n      - '28.7'\n      - '3.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs hop depth, with error bars from 3 seeds'\n  analysis: '2-hop 是 sweet spot 但差异在噪声范围内。论文中简要报告作为 design justification， 不作为独立 finding。\n\n    '\n- name: Training data size scaling ablation\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances, 测试 data scaling behavior\n  expected_results:\n    size_1k_qwen_R1: 0.518\n    size_3k_qwen_R1: 0.541\n    size_5k_qwen_R1: 0.538\n    size_1k_embed_delta_pp: 1.8\n    size_3k_embed_delta_pp: 1.1\n    size_5k_embed_delta_pp: 0.9\n    size_1k_starcoder_R1: 0.432\n    size_3k_starcoder_R1: 0.451\n    size_5k_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 data scaling 呈 diminishing returns：1K→3K 有明显提升（+2.3pp），\n    3K→5K 几乎持平甚至微降（过拟合加剧，与 m2_full 观察到的 step 1000 后过拟合一致）。 更关键的是 embedding benefit\n    Δ 随数据量增加而缩小：1K 时 Δ=1.8pp（小数据下 hard negative 质量差异被放大），5K 时 Δ=0.9pp（更多数据提供足够 coverage，减少对\n    mining 策略的依赖）。 这对 median 叙事不利——暗示在更大数据规模下 embedding benefit 可能进一步缩水。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Data Scaling × Strategy (Qwen, embedding strategy)'\n    columns:\n    - Train Size\n    - random R@1\n    - embed R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - '0.500'\n      - '0.518'\n      - '+1.8'\n    - - 3K\n      - '0.530'\n      - '0.541'\n      - '+1.1'\n    - - 5K\n      - '0.529'\n      - '0.538'\n      - '+0.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs training data size, separate lines for random/embed/dataflow'\n  - 'Bar chart: embed Δ at each data size, showing diminishing gap'\n  analysis: 'Diminishing benefit at larger data scale 是 median 档的典型特征——方向正确但实际意义 随\n    scale 递减。论文中诚实报告，作为 limitation 的一部分。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion head ablation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined scoring\n  expected_results:\n    embed_only_qwen_R1: 0.538\n    struct_only_qwen_R1: 0.489\n    combined_qwen_R1: 0.541\n    embed_only_starcoder_R1: 0.451\n    struct_only_starcoder_R1: 0.412\n    combined_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n    combined_vs_embed_only_delta_pp: 0.3\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 structural features alone 表现较差（R@1=0.489），因为 CodeQL\n    dataflow features 是 binary/sparse 的，单独使用缺乏 fine-grained discrimination。 Combined\n    (embed + struct) 仅比 embed-only 好 +0.3pp——structural signal 的增量贡献在融合后被稀释，且 combined\n    model 有更多参数容易过拟合（与 step 1000 过拟合现象一致）。StarCoder 上 combined 甚至略低于 embed-only（-0.3pp），\n    因为 StarCoder 的 healthy representation space 不需要额外维度的信号。 这进一步支持 \"conditional benefit\"\n    的定性结论但效果量太小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Fusion Head Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Head\n    - Qwen R@1\n    - StarCoder R@1\n    rows:\n    - - embed-only\n      - '0.538'\n      - '0.451'\n    - - struct-only\n      - '0.489'\n      - '0.412'\n    - - combined\n      - '0.541'\n      - '0.448'\n  figures_description:\n  - Stacked bar chart showing contribution decomposition of embed vs struct features\n  analysis: 'Combined head 增益微乎其微，论文中报告为 \"structural features provide marginal additive\n    benefit in fusion\"。不值得作为独立 contribution point。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-distance weighted negatives ablation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: weighted sampling by dataflow distance vs binary connected/disconnected\n  expected_results:\n    binary_qwen_R1: 0.538\n    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.535\n    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.448\n    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.444\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 weighted sampling 不优于 binary。原因：CodeQL 提取的 dataflow\n    distance 分布高度 bimodal（connected with distance 1-2 占大多数，disconnected 占其余）， smooth\n    weighting 在这种分布上退化为近似 binary。且 weighted 引入的额外超参数 （distance decay function）在 n=123\n    repos 的数据量下难以 tune，noise 抵消了 理论上的 curriculum benefit。这是一个 null result，说明 binary\n    structural signal 已捕获大部分可用信息。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Qwen R@1\n    - StarCoder R@1\n    rows:\n    - - binary (current)\n      - '0.538'\n      - '0.448'\n    - - distance-weighted\n      - '0.535'\n      - '0.444'\n  figures_description:\n  - Histogram of dataflow distances showing bimodal distribution\n  analysis: 'Null result，论文中用一句话在 ablation section 报告：\"distance-weighted sampling\n    does not improve over binary selection, likely due to the bimodal distance distribution.\"\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench failure analysis\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 50 SweRank/BM25 failure cases 分类分析\n  expected_results:\n    total_analyzed: 50\n    category_retrieval_miss: 18\n    category_generation_fail: 22\n    category_test_flaky: 4\n    category_multi_file_needed: 6\n    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_helps: 5\n    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_neutral: 10\n    retrieval_miss_where_dataflow_hurts: 3\n    pct_dataflow_helps_of_retrieval_miss: 27.8\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 failure analysis 揭示 SWE-bench 上 retrieval 并非主要瓶颈——\n    50 个失败案例中仅 18 个（36%）是因为 retrieval miss，其余是 generation/test issues。 在 18 个 retrieval\n    miss 中，dataflow 仅帮助 5 个（27.8%）——这些是跨文件依赖链上的 bug，dataflow connectivity 确实提供了有用信号。但\n    10 个 neutral（文件间无 dataflow 关系或关系被 CodeQL 漏提取）和 3 个 hurt（dataflow 引入 noise 反而 distract）\n    使整体效果被抵消。这解释了为什么 plan_003 中 SWE-bench resolve rate 差异 <1pp。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Failure Category Distribution'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '%'\n    rows:\n    - - Retrieval miss\n      - '18'\n      - 36%\n    - - Generation failure\n      - '22'\n      - 44%\n    - - Flaky test\n      - '4'\n      - 8%\n    - - Multi-file needed\n      - '6'\n      - 12%\n  - name: 'Table: Dataflow Impact on Retrieval Misses'\n    columns:\n    - Dataflow effect\n    - Count\n    - '%'\n    rows:\n    - - Helps\n      - '5'\n      - 27.8%\n    - - Neutral\n      - '10'\n      - 55.6%\n    - - Hurts\n      - '3'\n      - 16.7%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Sankey diagram: failure categories → dataflow impact'\n  - 'Concrete example pair: one case where dataflow helped (cross-module dependency)\n    and one where it hurt (false connectivity)'\n  analysis: 'Failure analysis 提供定性 insight 但定量上支持 \"generation bottleneck dominates\n    retrieval differences\" 的结论。论文中用于 explain 为什么 SWE-bench Δ 小， 并 motivate future\n    work on generation-aware retrieval。\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative examples\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 5-10 cases where structural negatives changed retrieval outcome\n  expected_results:\n    positive_examples_found: 4\n    negative_examples_found: 2\n    ambiguous_examples: 2\n    total_curated: 8\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下能找到 4 个 convincing positive examples（dataflow negative\n    帮助 retriever 区分 lexically similar but structurally unrelated files），但也有 2 个 negative\n    examples（dataflow 引入的 structural bias 导致 miss）。 这与 median 的 \"directional but not\n    definitive\" 叙事一致。8 个案例中 pattern 不够 clean 来支持强因果推断——n=2 编码器 + case-by-case 分析 只能说明\n    mechanism 是 plausible 而非 proven。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: 2 positive + 1 negative case study panels, showing query → retrieved\n    files → gold files, with dataflow graph overlay'\n  analysis: '精选 cases 放入论文 qualitative section，明确标注 positive 和 negative examples 以保持学术诚实。reviewer\n    会 appreciate balanced presentation。\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature ablation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}, 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_tau005_random_R1: 0.521\n    qwen_tau005_embed_R1: 0.534\n    qwen_tau005_dataflow_R1: 0.53\n    qwen_tau010_random_R1: 0.533\n    qwen_tau010_embed_R1: 0.543\n    qwen_tau010_dataflow_R1: 0.538\n    qwen_tau020_random_R1: 0.524\n    qwen_tau020_embed_R1: 0.531\n    qwen_tau020_dataflow_R1: 0.527\n    starcoder_tau005_random_R1: 0.438\n    starcoder_tau005_embed_R1: 0.443\n    starcoder_tau005_dataflow_R1: 0.43\n    starcoder_tau010_random_R1: 0.449\n    starcoder_tau010_embed_R1: 0.456\n    starcoder_tau010_dataflow_R1: 0.441\n    starcoder_tau020_random_R1: 0.442\n    starcoder_tau020_embed_R1: 0.446\n    starcoder_tau020_dataflow_R1: 0.435\n    embed_benefit_direction_consistent_across_tau: true\n    dataflow_benefit_direction_inconsistent: true\n    optimal_tau: 0.1\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 temperature ablation 证明 embedding > random 的方向在所有 τ\n    值下一致 （这是好消息，说明发现非 regime-specific）。但 Δ 在 τ=0.05 和 τ=0.2 下缩小： τ=0.05 时 loss landscape\n    过于 sharp，所有策略表现都下降，差异被 noise 淹没； τ=0.2 时 loss 太平滑，hard negatives 的难度梯度被抹平。τ=0.1\n    是 sweet spot。 Dataflow 的方向在 τ 间不一致——τ=0.05 时 Qwen 上 dataflow 略优于 random， τ=0.2\n    时略劣——进一步支持 \"conditional and fragile\" 的定性判断。 Cross-seed 方差在 τ=0.05 下最大（~3.0pp std），τ=0.1\n    最稳定（~1.8pp std）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Temperature × Strategy R@1 (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - random\n    - embed\n    - dataflow\n    - embed Δ\n    - dataflow Δ\n    rows:\n    - - '0.05'\n      - '0.521'\n      - '0.534'\n      - '0.530'\n      - '+1.3'\n      - '+0.9'\n    - - '0.10'\n      - '0.533'\n      - '0.543'\n      - '0.538'\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '+0.5'\n    - - '0.20'\n      - '0.524'\n      - '0.531'\n      - '0.527'\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '+0.3'\n  - name: 'Table: Temperature × Strategy R@1 (StarCoder)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - random\n    - embed\n    - dataflow\n    - embed Δ\n    - dataflow Δ\n    rows:\n    - - '0.05'\n      - '0.438'\n      - '0.443'\n      - '0.430'\n      - '+0.5'\n      - −0.8\n    - - '0.10'\n      - '0.449'\n      - '0.456'\n      - '0.441'\n      - '+0.7'\n      - −0.8\n    - - '0.20'\n      - '0.442'\n      - '0.446'\n      - '0.435'\n      - '+0.4'\n      - −0.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: τ × strategy, cell color = R@1, separate panels for Qwen and StarCoder'\n  - 'Line plot: embed Δ vs τ, showing consistent positive direction'\n  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 是 median 档的关键正面结果之一：embedding benefit 方向 robust\n    across τ。 论文中重点报告此 robustness 作为 Claim 1 的 supporting evidence， 同时 acknowledge\n    Claim 2 (dataflow) 的 τ-sensitivity 作为 limitation。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic mining baseline\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: re-mine embedding negatives per epoch vs static (mine once from pretrained)\n  expected_results:\n    static_qwen_R1: 0.543\n    dynamic_qwen_R1: 0.547\n    static_starcoder_R1: 0.456\n    dynamic_starcoder_R1: 0.452\n    dynamic_vs_static_qwen_delta_pp: 0.4\n    dynamic_vs_static_starcoder_delta_pp: -0.4\n    dynamic_compute_overhead_factor: 3.2\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 dynamic mining 在 Qwen 上微优（+0.4pp）但 StarCoder 上微劣（-0.4pp），\n    差异在 noise 范围内。原因：(1) static mining 在仅 3 epoch 的训练中 representation drift 有限——encoder\n    是 LoRA fine-tune，参数变化量小，pretrained 时的 embedding distance 排序在训练后基本保持；(2) dynamic\n    re-mining 引入计算开销（3.2x）但因 LoRA 的低 drift 几乎不改变 negative selection；(3) StarCoder\n    上 dynamic 略差可能因 re-mining 引入的 randomness（每次 re-mining 的 batch 不完全一致）。结论：static\n    vs dynamic 不是 关键 confound，当前 static 设计合理。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Static vs Dynamic Mining'\n    columns:\n    - Mining\n    - Qwen R@1\n    - StarCoder R@1\n    - GPU hours\n    rows:\n    - - Static (current)\n      - '0.543'\n      - '0.456'\n      - '3.5'\n    - - Dynamic (per-epoch)\n      - '0.547'\n      - '0.452'\n      - '11.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: static vs dynamic R@1, with compute cost annotation'\n  analysis: 'Null result for practical purposes. 论文中一句话报告：\"dynamic re-mining does\n    not significantly improve over static mining given the limited representation\n    drift in LoRA fine-tuning (3 epochs)\"。排除了 reviewer concern about static/dynamic\n    confound。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Lite\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 95% bootstrap CI for resolve rate differences\n  expected_results:\n    embed_vs_random_delta_pp: 0.4\n    embed_vs_random_95ci_lower: -1.8\n    embed_vs_random_95ci_upper: 2.6\n    dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp: -0.3\n    dataflow_vs_random_95ci_lower: -2.5\n    dataflow_vs_random_95ci_upper: 1.9\n    bootstrap_n: 10000\n    embed_vs_random_p_value: 0.34\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 SWE-bench 的 Δ ≤ 1pp，在 300 instances 上 bootstrap CI\n    极宽。 300 实例的 binomial 标准误约 ±2.2pp（at resolve rate ~18%）， 所以 Δ=0.4pp 的 95% CI 为\n    [-1.8, +2.6]，包含零。p=0.34 远不显著。 这是 median 档的核心弱点：无法宣称下游收益。 Dataflow 的 CI 同样包含零且\n    point estimate 为负。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Bootstrap CI'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - embed vs random\n      - '+0.4'\n      - '[−1.8, +2.6]'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - dataflow vs random\n      - −0.3\n      - '[−2.5, +1.9]'\n      - '0.41'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: point estimates with 95% CI bars, reference line at zero'\n  analysis: 'CI 均包含零，论文中必须诚实报告 \"no statistically significant difference in downstream\n    resolve rate\"。但可同时 argue retrieval-level improvements (plan_002/plan_013) 的 bootstrap\n    CI 更紧（pool=50 的 val set 上）， downstream pipeline 的 noise 是 confound 而非 evidence\n    against retrieval gains。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference-time graph method comparison discussion\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: 与 CodexGraph, LocAgent 等 inference-time 方法的定位比较\n  expected_results:\n    comparison_type: qualitative_discussion\n    codexgraph_reported_R1_improvement_pp: 5.2\n    locagent_reported_resolve_rate_pct: 26.3\n    structfuse_retrieval_R1: 0.543\n    key_distinction: training-time vs inference-time structural signal\n    complementarity_argument_strength: moderate\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下此项为 qualitative discussion 而非实验。StructFuse（training-time\n    structural mining）与 CodexGraph/LocAgent（inference-time graph navigation） 在方法论上互补：前者提升\n    base retriever 质量，后者在 inference 时做 multi-hop reasoning。但 median 档下 StructFuse\n    的 absolute improvement 较小（+1pp R@1）， complementarity argument 的说服力为 \"moderate\"——reviewer\n    可能问 \"if inference-time methods already get +5pp, why bother with +1pp training-time\n    improvement?\" 回应：training-time improvement 是 zero-cost at inference，可叠加使用。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Training-time vs Inference-time Structural Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Type\n    - Structural Signal\n    - Inference Cost\n    - Reported Gain\n    rows:\n    - - StructFuse (ours)\n      - training-time\n      - CodeQL dataflow\n      - zero\n      - +0.5–1.5pp R@1\n    - - CodexGraph\n      - inference-time\n      - LLM-built graph\n      - high (LLM calls)\n      - +5.2pp R@1\n    - - LocAgent\n      - inference-time\n      - call graph navigation\n      - moderate\n      - 26.3% resolve\n  figures_description:\n  - Comparison table in Related Work section\n  analysis: Discussion section 而非实验。定位 StructFuse 为 complementary approach—— zero\n    inference cost, improves base retriever that inference-time methods build upon.\n    Acknowledge median 档的 modest gains 使此 argument 需要 future work validation。\n","numLines":639,"startLine":1,"totalLines":639}}}
