{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AEcRmAK1qJVUhVWiVizKjy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 structfuse-context 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (31 个)\\n\\n- **p2b_eval_4runs_pool50**: DONE (success) — \\n- **d007_50repo_overlap**: DONE (success) — \\n- **p2b_5reruns**: DONE (success) — \\n- **p2b_eval_4runs_v2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **p2b-all-9runs**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke8**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke7**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke6**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke5**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke4**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **p2b-smoke-test**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_p2a_linear_proxy**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_p1_codeql_feasibility**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| m2_full_starcoder | Full M2 StarCoder: 3 strategies × 3 seeds on full M1 data. Cross-encoder validation — if embedding > random holds for both Qwen and StarCoder, method is encoder-agnostic. Resolves plan_013 pilot negative (dataflow encoder-dependent). | — | — | — |\\n| m2_full_qwen | Full M2 Qwen: 3 strategies (random/embedding/dataflow) × 3 seeds on full M1 data (~11K train/seed). Statistical validation of pilot signal (embedding > random +2pp). Go/no-go for paper claims per D018. | — | — | — |\\n| m1_reextract_v2 | M1 重提取 v2：恢复 28,276 个因运行时瞬态文件系统故障失败的 instances（82 repos）。CodeQL pack 已修复，端到端测试通过。预期将训练数据从 15,897 提升至 ~44,173。D022 批准。 | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **neg_difficulty_analysis** (success): Negative difficulty distribution analysis: 用预训练 Qwen2.5-Coder-3B 和 StarCoder2-3B 计算 3 策略 (random/embedding/dataflow) 的 query-negative/positive cosine similarity，分析 pretrained representation separability 跨编码器差异。MAX_LENGTH=2048 匹配训练设置。\\n- **m1_reextract** (failed): M1 重提取：恢复 28,2