{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017UMvMTaeQ2JQm8BkFhAwnd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# StructFuse — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 01:47 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer warnings 落地: m1_reextract_v2 定位明确 (camera-ready not current submission), plan_015/017 写作处理方案, experiment_plan 更新待排\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n\\\\\\\"Hard negative mining for code retrieval: what works, what doesn't, and why\\\\\\\" — 系统性分析 + 机制解释论文。详见 paper_framing.md（D024 重写后）。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（post-MVP）+ 审稿进行中\\\\n- **Framing 重写完成 (D024)**: 旧 Claim 2 (\\\\\\\"embedding harms\\\\\\\") 已证伪并移除；新叙事线：embedding universally helps → dataflow conditionally helps → mechanistic explanation via representation saturation\\\\n- **Full M2 训练中**: Qwen random_s42 running (best R@1=55.3% @step1000, overfitting @1500); StarCoder random_s42 running (R@1=45.4% @step1000, still improving)\\\\n- **M1 reextract v2 进行中**: 4 workers 并行 CodeQL 提取，~13% 进度\\\\n- **Plan_003 SWE-bench eval**: Pipeline ready (dry-run v2 PASS), 等 M2 checkpoint\\\\n- **Plan_014 temp ablation**: 脚本 D025 缩减完成 (6 runs, ~70h), 等 M2 释放 GPU\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Qwen eval@2000 → 确认过拟合 → 剩余 8 seeds 减至 2 epochs (节省 ~48h/GPU)\\\\n- [ ] neg_difficulty 可视化 Figure（0 GPU-h，论文核心差异化图表）— 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] M2 full 18 runs 完成 → 统计检验 (bootstrap CI, paired t-test)\\\\n- [ ] M2 完成后: plan_014 temperature ablation (双卡 ~35h wall time)\\\\n- [ ] M2 Qwen best checkpoint → plan_003 SWE-bench Lite eval\\\\n- [ ] plan_004 RepoBench-R 第二 benchmark\\\\n- [ ] experiment_plan.yaml 更新: plan_002/013 关联 full M2 registry_id, plan_014 budget 修正\\\\n- [ ] 写作时: plan_015 (dynamic mining) → Limitation 段落; plan_017 (inference-time graph) → Discussion 段落 (0 GPU-h)\\\\n\\\\n## Go/No-Go 阈值 (D019/D020, 适配 D024 新 framing)\\\\n\\\\n**Claim 1 (embedding vs random)**: 预期 Go — pilot 已一致确认 (+1.6~2.0pp)。Full M2 提供 3-seed CI。\\\\n**Claim 2 (dataflow conditional benefit)**: 预期 Conditional Go — Qwen 正向、StarCoder 中性。Full M2 量化 interaction effect。\\\\n**n=3 功效限制**: df=2, Type II error 高。Discussion 必须讨论。\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- **bjb1-42106**: 2× RTX PRO 6000 96GB（专属）\\\\n  - cuda:0: m2_full_qwen (seed 1/9, step ~1550/4242)\\\\n  - cuda:1: m2_full_starcoder (seed 1/9, step ~1000/4242)\\\\n- **剩余**: ~140 GPU-h needed for plan_003/014/004/015 | 瓶颈是 M2 完成时间非总量\\\\n- **过拟合缩减**: 若 eval@2000 确认，2 epochs 节省 ~96h 总计，M2 约 May 18-19 完成（vs May 20-21）\\\\n\\\\n## m1_reextract_v2 定位\\\\n当前 M2 使用 15.9K structural data 训练。reextract_v2 完成后数据量预计 ~30K+，但 May 25 前无法重跑 M2（~200+ GPU-h）。**用途：camera-ready revision 或后续投稿的 scalability 证据**，不影响当前投稿关键路径。当前价值：Claim 3 (CodeQL scalability) 的 coverage 数字更新。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键风险\\\\n1. **ARR deadline May 25**: 关键路径 M2(~May 18) → plan_014(~May 19.5) → plan_003(~May 21) → 统计+初稿(~May 24)\\\\n2. **n=3 统计功效**: pilot <2pp 差异在 df=2 下极难显著\\\\n3. **plan_015 未做**: static vs dynamic mining confound 由 2/3 dream reviewers 提出，需 Limitation 段承认\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-14 | M2 剩余 runs 加 early stopping (patience=2 evals)，加速关 | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D026 | 2026-05-14 | Qwen eval@2000 确认过拟合，后续 M2 runs 从 3 epochs 减至 2 ep | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D025 | 2026-05-14 | Plan_014 temperature ablation 缩减为 2 strategies × 3 | m2_full_qwen, plan_014 |\\\\n| D024 | 2026-05-14 | Major paper framing rewrite: drop falsified \\\\\\\"embed | m2_embed_verify, plan_013_starcoder, neg_difficulty_analysis |\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-13 | Kill M1 重提取：bjb1 CodeQL 查询 100% 失败，D022 前提不成立需诊断后重 | m1_reextract |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-13 | M1 28K instances 可恢复（运行时故障非数据问题）；当前 M2 继续，并行后台重跑 M | m1_extraction, plan_006_scalability |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-13 | Negative difficulty 分析揭示 encoder capacity 差异是 data | m2_embed_verify, plan_013_starcoder |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-13 | D019 补充：Claim 2 完整判定矩阵 + n=3 功效限制声明 | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-13 | D018 补充：Full M2 go/no-go 量化阈值 + 统计检验方案 | m2_full_qwen, m2_full_starcoder |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-13 | 不做预判性 framing pivot，full M2 (18 runs) 是 go/no-go 唯 | m2_embed_verify, plan_013_starcoder |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3742, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01QNTXiJZc3ypYERFAX1b5fX","session_id":"f4534d40-6470-414b-bd76-f15880fb0e07","uuid":"d233fd89-aa78-4f71-bfc6-7c6854e71608","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:31:27.491Z"}
