{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EHi8RarCdmQDo2WSWMBvSb","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 28\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 09:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 设计: CodeQL 试点(10 repos) + 迷你对比训练(500 instances) 验证核心假设'\\\\n  rationale: 13 天 DDL，需要最快速验证核心假设链：(1) CodeQL inter-procedural data-flow 在 Python\\\\n    repos 上可行（timeout < 30%），(2) data-flow hard negatives 比 random negatives 提升检索\\\\n    recall。两个 phase 串行，总计约 1 天。通过后立即进入全量数据提取和训练。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 10:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: '采纳 Reviewer 反馈: MVP Phase 2 增加线性分类器 proxy 验证 + 3-seed 训练 + 显式 kill criteria'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 Phase 2 原方案（500 instances, ~100 held-out, 2pp gate）统计效力不足，2pp\\\\n    差异在随机噪声范围内。增加: (1) Phase 2a 线性分类器 proxy 验证解耦特征质量与训练策略；(2) 3-seed 训练要求 ≥2/3 seed\\\\n    提升；(3) 每个 phase 的 fail→kill/fallback 路径。防止 13 天 DDL 下的沉没成本陷阱。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 10:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'H2 验证并入 Phase 1: 提取后立即统计 data-flow 连通文件 vs 不连通文件的 gold patch 覆盖率差异'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 H2（特征区分度）在原 MVP 中无独立验证，Phase 2 失败时无法区分是 H2 还是 H3 问题。零成本 sanity\\\\n    check（统计连通/不连通文件的 gold patch 覆盖率）可在 Phase 1 提取完后立即执行，不需要训练。这比 Phase 2a 的线性分类器更早给出诊断信号。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 11:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Phase 1 gate PASS: timeout 0%, H2 Fisher p=1.54e-7, 75% instance recall.\\\\n    进入 Phase 2。'\\\\n  rationale: 10 repos 中 8 个成功提取（2 个 skip 因 buggy file 路径不存在，非 CodeQL 限制）。timeout rate\\\\n    0% 远低于 30% 阈值。H2 sanity check：连通文件 gold 覆盖 1.44% vs 不连通 0.00%，Fisher p=1.54e-7。75%\\\\n    instance recall（6/8 gold file 在连通集）。数据质量问题（路径匹配、skip rate、registry 注册）并行修复，不阻塞\\\\n    Phase 2。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 11:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'CRITICAL: GPU 越界 PID 59170 跑在 GPU 5 而非分配的 cuda:4，立即 kill + 全脚本修复 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 核实 nvidia-smi 发现 run_mvp.py 在 GPU 5 上运行 9.3GB，而项目分配的 cuda:4\\\\n    完全空闲。违反 L1 红线（GPU 资源边界）。要求 Agent 立即 kill 进程、修复所有脚本强制 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4、排查\\\\n    dry-run 是否也越界。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 17:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: P2b pass criteria 调整：recall@5→recall@1，pool_size 26→50+，阈值 ≥2pp 不变\\\\n  rationale: Eval v2 (pool_size=26) 显示 random recall@5 已达 98.4-99.2%，原标准\\\\\\\"dataflow\\\\n    recall@5 > random ≥2pp\\\\\\\"数学上几乎不可能达标（天花板仅 0.8-1.6pp 空间）。recall@1 有更大区分度（random mean\\\\n    93.97%），且是更严格的排序指标。同时扩大 pool_size 至 50+ 使 recall@5/10 也获得有效梯度。新标准：dataflow_aware\\\\n    recall@1 > random recall@1 ≥2pp in ≥2/3 seeds，pool_size=50。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_p2b_contrastive_training\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: random recall@1 mean=0.940, emb_dist recall@1=0.669 at pool=26; recall@5\\\\n      ceiling\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 19:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP P2b dataflow 策略不可验证：connected⊆gold 导致数据相同。决定：50-repo 规模验证 + Scheme\\\\n    B 备份\\\\n  rationale: 修复 build_p2b_data.py 后重新生成数据，train_dataflow.jsonl 仍与 train_embedding.jsonl\\\\n    完全相同。根因：8 个 MVP repos 中 dataflow 连接文件全部是 gold 文件的子集（connected-but-not-gold = 0），non_pos\\\\n    过滤无差异。这不是方法缺陷而是规模问题——小 repo 紧耦合，2-hop 连接集≈gold 集。P1（Fisher p=1.54e-7）和 P2a（AUC=0.78）仍有效，说明\\\\n    dataflow connectivity 有信号，只是 MVP 规模不足以分离 connected-but-not-gold 子集。决策：(1) 立即跑\\\\n    50-repo 样本的 overlap 统计（CPU, ~2-4h），确认大规模下 connected⊃gold；(2) 并行准备 Scheme B（distance-weighted\\\\n    negatives）作为 pivot 备选；(3) overlap>20% 实例有 connected≠gold → 进入全量 M1 提取；overlap≈100%\\\\n    → pivot to Scheme B。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_p2b_contrastive_training\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: dataflow≡embedding 因 connected⊆gold\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 20:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 条件性通过：P1+P2a PASS，P2b dataflow 在 MVP 规模不可测但 50-repo 规模验证确认方法可行（Z=40.8%）。进入\\\\n    research 阶段。\\\\n  rationale: MVP 三阶段结果：P1 PASS（timeout 0%, Fisher p=1.54e-7, 75% instance recall）；P2a\\\\n    PASS（AUC 0.78, BM25 系数为负）；P2b 部分有效——random>>embedding（-27pp recall@1 at pool=26,\\\\n    -3.7pp at pool=50）确认 naive hard negatives 有害，但 dataflow vs random 因 connected⊆gold\\\\n    无法在 8 repos 上区分。50-repo 规模验证 Z=40.8%（中型 repo 55.7%），timeout 4%，确认方法在全量数据上可行。Kill\\\\n    criteria 均未触发。P2b dataflow 对比将在 M2 全量训练中完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_p1_codeql_feasibility\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_p2a_linear_proxy\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_p2b_contrastive_training\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: partial - random>>emb confirmed, dataflow untestable at MVP scale\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 22:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿完成：best=Weak Accept, median=Weak Reject, worst=Reject。批准 P0 启动，但\\\\n    plan 需增补 5 个 dream-derived 实验\\\\n  rationale: 三档共识问题：(1) 单编码器无法支撑 generality claim，需加 StarCoder/CodeBERT；(2) static\\\\n    vs dynamic embedding mining 是潜在 confound；(3) τ=0.05 可能 regime-specific；(4) SWE-bench\\\\n    +2pp 需 bootstrap CI；(5) abstract \\\\\\\"complementary\\\\\\\" 需降调。关键风险变量是 M1 的 Z%：≥35% best\\\\n    framing 成立，20-35% pivot 到 Claim 2 headline，<20% 需重大调整。已在 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n    增加 plan_013-017（+35h GPU），paper_framing.md 增加 contingency framing。P0 实验（M1 已在跑）可继续，不需\\\\n    re-dream。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260512T204322\\\\n    role: dream_simulate\\\\n    result: best=WA, median=WR, worst=R\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-12 22:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_013 (second encoder) 从 P