eriments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m1_extraction\\\\n    role: data_source\\\\n    result: 123/131 repos, 44173 instances, 15897 structural\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scalability\\\\n    role: prior_pilot\\\\n    result: pilot Z%=72.5% on 29 repos\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Reviewer Critical: m2_embed_verify 和 plan_013_starcoder 实际已完成全部 3 策略，registry\\\\n    错误标记为 failed'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 直接从服务器日志验证：两个实验的 dataflow 策略均已完成（\\\\\\\"All 3 strategies completed\\\\\\\"），EXIT_CODE\\\\n    异常发生在训练完成之后（wrapper 脚本问题）。关键数据：(1) Qwen dataflow peak R@1=0.5584 (+2.27pp vs random)，支撑\\\\n    Claim 1；(2) StarCoder dataflow R@1=0.4869 < random 0.4922，encoder-agnostic claim\\\\n    受挑战；(3) 两个编码器的 dataflow 策略均严重过拟合（train loss→0）。已派 Agent 紧急修正 registry + 收集完整 metrics\\\\n    + 验证 StarCoder random 数据来源。方向决策待 Agent 汇报验证数据后确定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_embed_verify\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 实际完成（3 strategies all done），Qwen dataflow peak R@1=0.5584\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013_starcoder\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 实际完成（3 strategies all done），StarCoder dataflow R@1=0.4869 < random 0.4922\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 16:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pilot 结果验证完成：embedding > random 跨编码器一致；dataflow 需按两种 checkpoint 标准报告；Claim\\\\n    2 需修订\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 验证 18 个指标全部精确匹配。核心发现：(1) embedding > random 在 Qwen (+2.0pp)\\\\n    和 StarCoder (+1.6pp) 上一致，是最稳健结论；(2) dataflow 排名取决于 checkpoint 选择——按 val_loss:\\\\n    embedding > dataflow > random (Qwen)，按 peak R@1: dataflow > embedding > random\\\\n    (Qwen)；(3) StarCoder dataflow final eval 追平 embedding (0.5078=0.5078)，\\\\\\\"embedding\\\\n    consistently beats dataflow\\\\\\\" 不成立；(4) Claim 2 (\\\\\\\"embedding harms\\\\\\\") 在 true embedding\\\\n    mining 下不复现，仅在 MVP BM25 proxy 下成立。全量 M2 训练需报告两种 checkpoint 标准下的结果，避免 cherry-picking\\\\n    质疑。Paper framing 修订延后至全量 M2 结果出来后。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_embed_verify\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'Qwen: embedding(0.5557) > dataflow(0.5436) > random(0.5357) by val_loss;\\\\n      dataflow peak(0.5584) > embedding(0.5557) by R@1'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013_starcoder\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'StarCoder: embedding(0.5078) > random(0.4922) > dataflow(0.4869) by val_loss;\\\\n      dataflow final(0.5078) = embedding'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 16:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 不做预判性 framing pivot，full M2 (18 runs) 是 go/no-go 唯一判据；双 checkpoint 标准；准备\\\\n    B/C 两条后备路线\\\\n  rationale: Pilot 仅 24 repos / 1 seed，<2pp delta 统计功效不足以支持强 claim 或否决原假设。Full M2\\\\n    (131 repos × 3 strategies × 3 seeds × 2 encoders = 18 runs) 提供 3-seed 统计功效，是唯一可信判据。不选\\\\n    Agent 提议的 A/B/C 任何一个——过早锁定叙事会限制后续解读空间。数据构建已在进行，不浪费时间在 framing 讨论上。Full M2 结果出来后根据实际数据\\\\n    pattern 决定：(a) dataflow 跨编码器一致 > random → 原 framing 修正后可用；(b) dataflow 不一致但 embedding\\\\n    一致 → 方案 B 或 C；(c) 所有差异不显著 → 需要更大规模实验或 pivot。同时要求 dual checkpoint (best-val-loss\\\\n    + best-R@1) 和 3-seed CI 确保结果可信。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_embed_verify\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: pilot underpowered (1 seed, 24 repos)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013_starcoder\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: pilot underpowered (1 seed, 24 repos)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: D018 补充：Full M2 go/no-go 量化阈值 + 统计检验方案\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 D018 缺量化阈值，go/no-go 判据需在结果出来前明确，避免事后 rationalization。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **统计方法**：每个 encoder 3 seeds 的 R@1 (best-by-val-loss checkpoint) 做 paired difference，bootstrap\\\\n    95% CI + paired t-test (p<0.05)。同时报告 best-by-R@1 checkpoint 结果作为透明度补充。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **Go/No-Go 阈值**：\\\\n\\\\n    (A) Go — 原 framing 可用：dataflow > random 的 95% CI 在两个 encoder 上均 > 0\\\\n\\\\n    (B) Conditional Go — 修正 framing：dataflow > random 在至少一个 encoder 上 CI > 0，另一个 CI\\\\n    含 0（差异不显著）\\\\n\\\\n    (C) No-Go for Claim 1：dataflow ≤ random 在两个 encoder 上 CI 均含 0 或为负 → Claim 1 失效，pivot\\\\n    到 \\\\\\\"mining strategy × architecture\\\\\\\" 分析论文\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **Claim 2 判据**：若 full M2 显示 embedding > random 且 CI > 0 → 原 Claim 2 (\\\\\\\"embedding\\\\n    harms\\\\\\\") 被否定。新 Claim 2 候选：\\\\\\\"true embedding mining helps, but BM25 proxy harms\\\\\\\" 或\\\\n    \\\\\\\"hard negative mining method matters more than hard negative source\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **跨 encoder 一致性规则**：\\\\n\\\\n    - 同方向同显著 → 强泛化 claim\\\\n\\\\n    - 同方向不同显著 → 条件 claim + architecture discussion\\\\n\\\\n    - 反方向 → Claim 1 原形式被拒，需 conditional reframe\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    阈值在 full M2 结果出来前锁定，不允许事后修改。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_qwen\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RUNNING - random_s42 in progress\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_starcoder\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RUNNING - data build phase\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: D019 补充：Claim 2 完整判定矩阵 + n=3 功效限制声明\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 D019 的 Claim 2 阈值不完整 + n=3 统计功效天然受限。补充如下：\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **Claim 2 完整判定矩阵**（3 seeds, paired bootstrap 95% CI）：\\\\n\\\\n    (i) random > embedding CI>0 → Claim 2 confirmed（embedding harms，与 MVP 一致）\\\\n\\\\n    (ii) embedding > random CI>0 → Claim 2 falsified（true embedding mining helps，需\\\\n    reframe）\\\\n\\\\n    (iii) CI 含 0 → inconclusive（效应存在但检测不到或确实无差异，论文报告为 \\\\\\\"no significant difference\\\\\\\"\\\\n    + 报告 effect size）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **n=3 功效限制**（显式承认，不修改阈值）：\\\\n\\\\n    - df=2 时 t 临界值 4.303，pilot 级别差异（<2pp）极难达到 p<0.05\\\\n\\\\n    - Bootstrap n=3 仅 27 种重采样，CI 估计粗糙\\\\n\\\\n    - 阈值框架偏向 No-Go（Type II error 高）\\\\n\\\\n    - 若结果落入 (C) No-Go，论文 Discussion 必须讨论功效限制，不能简单声明 \\\\\\\"dataflow 无效\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    - 这是算力约束下的合理选择，不改阈值，但明确风险\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **plan_014 排期**：Full M2 完成后优先启动 plan_014（temperature ablation, ~10h）——无论 Claim\\\\n    2 reframe 成哪个方向，temperature regime-specificity 都需要回答。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_qwen\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_starcoder\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: Negative difficulty 分析揭示 encoder capacity 差异是 dataflow 效果不一致的根因\\\\n  rationale: '预训练模型 cosine similarity 分析显示：Qwen pretrained embeddings 分辨力弱（random\\\\n    cosine sim 0.899），StarCoder 分辨力强（random cosine sim 0.553）。Dataflow negatives 在两个模型上都比\\\\n    random 更难（higher sim），说明方法设计正确。但 StarCoder 已经\\\\\\\"懂\\\\\\\"结构差异（所有策略 sim 都低），额外训练信号边际收益小。这解释了\\\\n    pilot 中 StarCoder dataflow < random 的现象：不是方法问题，是 encoder 已有足够 capacity。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    论文价值：(1) 从 negative result 中提取 mechanistic explanation；(2) 定义 method applicability\\\\n    condition：\\\\\\\"structure-grounded negatives benefit most when pretrained encoder has\\\\n    limited structural separability\\\\\\\"；(3) 产出论文级图表（Figure: Negative Difficulty Distributions）；(4)\\\\n    无论 full M2 落入 A/B/C，这个分析都增加论文深度。不修改 go/no-go 阈值，但丰富解读框架。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_embed_verify\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 'Qwen: dataflow > random (+0.8~2.3pp)'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013_starcoder\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 'StarCoder: dataflow < random (-0.5pp), explained by high pretrained separability'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: M1 28K instances 可恢复（运行时故障非数据问题）；当前 M2 继续，并行后台重跑 M1 提取\\\\n  rationale: 'Fuzzy match 抽查 10/10 发现 buggy_file 全部存在——28,276 个 \\\\\\\"error\\\\\\\" 是 CodeQL 并行提取时的运行时故障（磁盘/存储瞬态），不是\\\\n    SWE-smith 数据质量问题。训练数据潜在从 15,897 → ~44,173（2.8x）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    决策：不中断当前 M2 训练 + 并行后台重跑 M1 提取。理由：\\\\n\\\\n    (1) 当前 M2 已在双卡运行，中断重来延期 3-7 天超出 DDL\\\\n\\\\n    (2) M1 重提取是 CPU 工作，可在 bjb1-42106 后台运行不影响 GPU 训练\\\\n\\\\n    (3) 如果当前 M2 结果落入 (C) No-Go 或 effect size 太小，扩展数据集是 natural next step\\\\n\\\\n    (4) 2.8x 数据量可能显著缓解 dataflow 过拟合问题（D021 中的核心风险）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    Claim 3 叙事需修正：\\\\\\\"64% failure 是上游数据问题\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"64% 是运行时提取故障，CodeQL 本身在有效输入上 100% 成功，可通过重跑恢复\\\\\\\"。这是\\\\n    engineering limitation with clear fix，不是方法局限。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m1_extraction\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 28,276 instances recoverable - runtime failure, not data quality\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scalability\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 'error classification needs correction: buggy_file_not_found was misattributed'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill M1 重提取：bjb1 CodeQL 查询 100% 失败，D022 前提不成立需诊断后重新评估\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL 发现 bjb1-42106 上 CodeQL call_graph.ql 查询全部 exit status\\\\n    2，317/325 行失败，零有效结构数据产出。原 M1 在 cqa1-21977 成功，迁移后 CodeQL 版本/QL pack 可能不兼容。立即 kill\\\\n    进程释放 CPU/RAM，诊断 CodeQL 配置后决定修复或换服务器。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m1_reextract\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: killed - CodeQL incompatible on bjb1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Major paper framing rewrite: drop falsified \\\\\\\"embedding harms\\\\\\\" claim, pivot\\\\n    to \\\\\\\"systematic analysis + mechanistic insight\\\\\\\" narrative'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer deep assessment confirmed Claim 2 (\\\\\\\"embedding actively harms\\\\\\\",\\\\n    -27pp) was built on BM25-proxy mislabeled as embedding-distance in MVP. D017 proved\\\\n    true embedding mining helps (+1.6-2.0pp). New framing: (1) embedding universally\\\\n    helps (corrects misconception), (2) dataflow conditionally helps (mediated by\\\\n    representation saturation), (3) CodeQL scalable. This is a stronger, more honest\\\\n    paper type for EMNLP — empirical analysis with mechanistic depth rather than false\\\\n    \\\\\\\"our method beats all\\\\\\\" claim.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_embed_verify\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: embedding > random confirmed for both encoders\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013_starcoder\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: dataflow helps Qwen only, not StarCoder — conditional benefit\\\\n  - exp_id: neg_difficulty_analysis\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: pos_sim saturation explains strategy-encoder interaction\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: Plan_014 temperature ablation 缩减为 2 strategies × 3τ × 2 epochs = 6 runs\\\\n    (~70h)，deadline 可达\\\\n  rationale: 原方案 9 runs × 3 epochs = 157h GPU，超出 May 25 ARR 截稿。缩减理由：(1) 回答 Dream reviewer\\\\n    的 regime-specificity concern 只需证明 embedding vs random 的相对优势跨 τ 一致，不需要 3 策略全跑；(2)\\\\n    M2 和 pilot 均显示 epoch 3 过拟合无收益，2 epochs 足够；(3) τ=0.07 已由 M2 覆盖，只需 {0.05, 0.1, 0.2}。6\\\\n    runs × ~11.7h = ~70h → 双卡并行 35h wall time，M2 完成后 ~1.5 天可跑完。Dataflow strategy 的\\\\n    τ ablation 降为 P2，时间充裕再补。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_qwen\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: step 1000 best, epoch 3 overfitting → 2 epochs sufficient\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: budget revised from 10h to 70h, scope from 9 to 6 runs\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Qwen eval@2000 确认过拟合，后续 M2 runs 从 3 epochs 减至 2 epochs\\\\n  rationale: 'eval@2000: val_loss=0.5162, R@1=0.5228（与 @1500 持平，未恢复）。Best 锁定 step\\\\n    1000 (epoch 1 中段)。train_loss=0.04 vs val_loss=0.52，gap 持续扩大。模式与 pilot 一致（best\\\\n    at ~25% training）。当前 s42 保留 3 epochs 完整跑完（提供 full overfitting curve 数据），后续 8 runs/encoder\\\\n    设 max_epochs=2。节省 ~48h/GPU，M2 完成时间从 ~May 20-21 提前到 ~May 18-19。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_qwen\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: eval@2000 R@1=0.5228 flat, overfitting confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_starcoder\\\\n    role: pending\\\\n    result: eval@1000 still improving, apply 2-epoch precaution for subsequent seeds\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: M2 剩余 runs 加 early stopping (patience=2 evals)，加速关键路径\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 计算 M2 全 18 runs 需 ~5.5 天（StarCoder 瓶颈 ~133h）。两个编码器 best checkpoint\\\\n    均在 step 1000，之后 val_loss 持续上升。加 early stopping（patience=2，即连续 2 次 eval@500 无改善即停）预计在\\\\n    step 2000 左右停止（vs 2828 full 2-epoch），节省 ~30% 时间（~1.5 天），M2 从 May 19.5 提前到 ~May\\\\n    18。关键路径 May 25 ARR 余量从 5 天增至 7 天。风险低：仅影响未启动的 runs，不改已跑数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_qwen\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running, best@1000, overfitting confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: m2_full_starcoder\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running, best@1000, overfitting confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 20054, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01T2vGW8zkgWuF9gLa3rqyUw","session_id":"f4534d40-6470-414b-bd76-f15880fb0e07","uuid":"bce09f5c-ff39-4b49-b7d4-17a661bbe572","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:31:51.620Z"}
